# external auto-placement in a fully pinned scene (`EXTERNAL-EDGE-ENDPOINTS` presentation):
# externals must land adjacent to their connected node in the flow
# direction, not at a far auto-layout rank. Semantic model is unchanged
# by the layout zone; this case pins down the parse of the scenario the
# render-side tools/boundary-check.js asserts geometry for (the tool keeps
# its filename; the keyword was renamed `external`).
figdown 0.1 block
external src "in"
external dst "out"
node ingress "Ingress"
node egress "Egress"
flow right
edge src -> ingress
edge ingress -> egress
edge egress -> dst
layout
pin ingress at=(82,55) width=175 height=34
pin egress at=(82,120) width=175 height=34
